        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:119s7ks",
          "html": "Talk to either <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Austri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Austri</a> (north of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Taverley_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Taverley lodestone</a>) or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vestri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vestri</a> (north of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Catherby_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Catherby lodestone</a>) who can both be found guarding caves on either side of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/White_Wolf_Mountain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Wolf Mountain</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to either Austri (north of the Taverley lodestone) or Vestri (north of the Catherby lodestone) who can both be found guarding caves on either side of White Wolf Mountain.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I was wondering what was down that tunnel?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Why not?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "If you were my friend I wouldn't mind it."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Well, let's be friends!"
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "And how am I meant to do that?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "✓",
                  "text": "[Accept Quest]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
