        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-some-help:1jv7sc6",
          "html": "If you don&#39;t have the worms:",
          "text": "If you don't have the worms:",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-some-help:1jv7sc6:tk5oux",
              "html": "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/McGrubor%27s_Wood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">McGrubor&#39;s Wood</a> just west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seers%27_Village_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seers&#39; Village lodestone</a> and enter through the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Loose_Railing_(McGrubor%27s_Wood)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">loose railing</a> along the north fence, or use fairy ring <b>A</b><b>L</b><b>S</b>.",
              "text": "Go to McGrubor's Wood just west of the Seers' Village lodestone and enter through the loose railing along the north fence, or use fairy ring ALS.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-some-help:1jv7sc6:ymej0h",
              "html": "Run to the west side of the woods and &#39;check&#39; the red-coloured <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vine_(McGrubor%27s_Wood)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vines</a> to receive <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Red_vine_worm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">red vine worms</a>; take at least three.",
              "text": "Run to the west side of the woods and 'check' the red-coloured vines to receive red vine worms; take at least three.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-some-help:1jv7sc6:f0udnf",
              "html": "Additionally, if you don&#39;t have <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Garlic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">garlic</a>, you can find one in the house south of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seer%27s_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seer&#39;s Village</a> anvil.",
              "text": "Additionally, if you don't have garlic, you can find one in the house south of the Seer's Village anvil.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-some-help:ev4hrs",
          "html": "Head to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hemenster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hemenster</a> (south-west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seers%27_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seers&#39; Village</a> and directly west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ranging_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ranging Guild</a>).",
          "text": "Head to Hemenster (south-west of Seers' Village and directly west of the Ranging Guild).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
